{"version":1,"content":"<p>藍牙技術即將迎來自誕生以來最重要的性能升級之一。藍牙技術聯盟（Bluetooth SIG）日前正式宣佈推出「高數據吞吐量」（High Data Throughput，簡稱HDT）技術，這項新標準將顯著提升藍牙低功耗（Bluetooth LE）的傳輸能力，為未來無線耳機、智能穿戴設備、電腦及流動裝置帶來更快的數據交換速度和更豐富的應用場景。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585044.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:45:40.419259+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T15:32:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:38:21.735446+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:38:21.735446+00:00","content_hash":"e48a8937a7c673b3407bbd0e810e7cb349328e01a3ca8ea9047d43d64ea093f1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}